(text "J1 feeds XIAO 5V and the existing 5V interfaces.\nXIAO 3V3 supplies CAN VIO, I2C, TMP102 and FLOW pull-up.\nUSB-C, LDO, BOOT and RESET are on the removable XIAO.\nDisconnect external J1 power before USB flashing." (at 18 68 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "81c4f18c-3224-5f82-9e15-36f21e8f3e43"))
