(text "2. XIAO ESP32-S3 - two female 1x7 sockets, 2.54mm pitch" (at 180 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ff6ec07e-79e8-5c14-abb2-2e203fc3ede1"))
(text "U1: D3/GPIO4 BOILER; D1/GPIO2 LED; D4/GPIO5 SDA; D5/GPIO6 SCL.\nD7/GPIO44 FLOW; D8/GPIO7 CAN TX; D9/GPIO8 CAN RX; D10/GPIO9 VALVE." (at 180 105 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0d28ad39-da16-5ab4-b45f-a754832e1f95"))
(text "Seeed numbering: 1..7 = D0..D6; 8..11 = D7..D10.\n12=3V3 OUT; 13=GND; 14=5V IN. Pins 15..25 are bottom pads, NC.\nD0/GPIO1, D2/GPIO3 and D6/GPIO43 are unused." (at 180 130 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ec393e3a-b8d6-5eb2-8d0a-1e280d377c08"))
(text "Footprint: Seeed_XIAO:XIAO-ESP32-S3-DIP.\nFit two female 1x7 sockets; XIAO fitted manually from stock.\nRow spacing 15.24mm; 2.54mm pitch. GPIO4 avoids boot straps." (at 180 157 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "020bb8ca-302a-5c0e-9b56-fd094dbdba5b"))
