(text "FUTURE PCB FIRMWARE: BOILER GPIO4, active HIGH (MOSFET driver).\nPreload LOW before output enable; disable heater pull-up.\nCurrent HW-399 firmware uses GPIO3, active LOW: do not use unchanged.\nOther existing XIAO pins retained; add status LED on GPIO2.\nFirmware unchanged; PCB placement and routing pending." (at 180 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "899e9430-72fc-5f6f-a9b8-39cc2e408b58"))
